WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 6 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.470
No, no, no, no!

2
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:10.970
Scoop! The dragon king caught making out with a human woman in broad daylight!

3
00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.970
That is not what happened. It was an accident.

4
00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.970
An accident, huh?

5
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:23.910
You really will go to any length to get my attention, won't you?

6
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.910
I didn't. I was just...

7
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.800
Trying to seduce me.

8
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.800
Your Majesty, I have absolutely no interest in you.

9
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.300
I swear, I will never, ever show my face in front of you again.

10
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.800
Good. Keep that promise.

11
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.800
Don't sneak into my castle and definitely don't wait for the guard shift at the top of the hour.

12
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.800
Slip through the broken window in the north tower, second from the left, and come looking for me. Got it?

13
00:00:50.800 --> 00:01:04.830
Crystal clear.

14
00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.830
Easy little elf.

15
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.830
His Majesty never lets anyone get on top of him.

16
00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:16.770
Unless he wants them there.

17
00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:18.770
What a sweet little angel.

18
00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:23.370
Just stay a little longer, please.

19
00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.870
We need to find a place to stay for the night.

20
00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.870
Perfect! Stay here!

21
00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.870
Free of charge!

22
00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:31.870
No, no. We couldn't possibly.

23
00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:37.870
I have plenty of empty rooms, and Amber doesn't want to leave her nana either, do you, sweetie?

24
00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:43.690
Maryn, thank you. Really.

25
00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:45.690
She's melting my heart.

26
00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:50.190
If Lyra marries Kale, I'll never have to be away from Amber again.

27
00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.190
Lyra, are you single?

28
00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:55.690
Because I have a son. A very handsome son.

29
00:01:55.690 --> 00:02:00.350
Speak of the devil!

30
00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:01.350
I...
